        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Kelly, the United States participant on Soyuz TMA-4\n- Space missions: Soyuz TMA-4, International Space Station Expeditions 26, 45, and 46\n- Records: most time in space\n\nFacts:\n- Soyuz TMA-4 included a United States participant.\n- The United States participant on Soyuz TMA-4 held a record of 381.6 days for the most time in space.\n- Scott Kelly broke the 381.6-day record for the most time in space.\n- Scott Kelly served as commander of the International Space Station on Expeditions 26, 45, and 46.",
